{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1785994691756604001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"wormy-grail-cherry","assignee":null,"author":"Joe Oakhart","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":2},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Joe Oakhart","body":"Remediated + committed as 2168ae18e. Corrected llm-framework.md child-closure section, CLAUDE.md completion-gate note, workflow-engine.md summary, and the completion-verification.yaml description to the post-30c2ef3ad blocking-vs-certification-withholding semantics; documented the certifiable field. Gate YAML still loads/validates; 66 tests green. Awaiting Gerrit landing.","timestamp":1783054440001605001}],"created_at":1783053682942633001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[],"description":"# Correct completion-gate child-closure docs (superseded by 30c2ef3ad)\n\n## What\nCommit `30c2ef3ad` split \"uncertified child\" from \"blocking child\": only an UNCLOSED direct child\nis now a deterministic FAIL; a closed-but-uncertified (force-closed) child lets the parent close\nUNSIGNED with `certifiable=false` (the LLM still runs on the parent's own criteria). The docs still\ndescribe the old semantics.\n\nFiles/lines to correct:\n- `docs/llm-framework.md:381-395` — \"any child not closed+certified -> FAIL without the LLM\" /\n  \"LLM only reached once all children are closed+signed\" (both now false); document `certifiable`.\n- `docs/llm-framework.md:424-427`, `docs/workflow-engine.md:35-37`, `CLAUDE.md` completion-gate\n  section — the \"unsigned close ⇒ validation did not pass\" biconditional (now has 2-3 causes).\n- `src/rebar/llm/workflow/gates/completion-verification.yaml:5-6` — description contradicts its own ops.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `llm-framework.md` child-closure section rewritten around blocking vs certification-withholding;\n      the `certifiable` verdict field documented.\n- [ ] The \"unsigned close\" claim qualified in all three docs (PASS signs iff certifiable).\n- [ ] The gate YAML description corrected; commit carries a `rebar-ticket:` trailer.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","9322-f84a-e047-4471"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"9322-f84a-e047-4471","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"e980-5af9-676c-4e32","ticket_type":"task","title":"Correct completion-gate child-closure docs (superseded by 30c2ef3ad)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ab3fcd0f-34cb-48b4-8af1-c84391d12c72","8b06a501-0fce-4f66-a58a-3d429bf71b19"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994691756604001,"uuid":"77390ddc-d6fd-42c9-bce0-3329d6831f2d"}